[h2]Build 0.9.4[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]SloppyMods Factory Logistics[/b]: the start of one mod for moving goods around a colony without hauling them by hand. This first build brings in the [b]pneumatic tubes[/b]: lay air tubes between rooms, power a compressor and fill an air tank, then pack goods into capsules at a packing bench and fire them from a tube sender to a receiver anywhere on the network. Pack bills work like any bill, including "do until you have X", which counts the goods already at the destination and on their way.
[*]Requires Vanilla Expanded Framework. Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory is optional: the conveyor arms that come next only load when it is installed.
[/list]
[list]
[*]First build: please report anything that does not load or work as described.
[/list]
